{% doc %}
  A work in the Permanent Collection as a tile (DESIGN.md §6.5, DS-62): the work whole on the mat,
  then its label in museum order: artist (bold), title (italic) and year, then the medium. The
  limited edition's tile without a price, so a work looks the same in the Shop and the collection.
  The whole tile links to the work's page. The picture keeps its own alt text from Files, which
  describes the work (Michael, 2026-09-28, amending DS-120); an alt that only repeats the title is
  dropped (DS-58). A work without an image gets the blank mat with "No image", so every label in
  the row starts at the same height (DS-109). gs-collection.js builds the same tile for the finder.

  @param {object} work - An artwork entry
  @param {string} [heading] - Heading element for the title: 'h2' (default) or 'h3'
  @param {boolean} [hide_artist] - Leave the artist's name off, on that artist's own page
  @param {string} [sizes] - The picture's sizes when the tile isn't in a grid of three

  @example
  {%- render 'gs-work-tile', work: work, heading: 'h3' -%}
{% enddoc %}
{%- liquid
  assign tag = heading | default: 'h2'
  capture names
    render 'gs-names', entries: work.artists.value
  endcapture
  assign names = names | strip
-%}
<article class="gs-artwork-tile">
  {%- assign image = nil -%}
  {%- for i in work.images.value limit: 1 -%}{%- assign image = i -%}{%- endfor -%}
  {%- if image != blank -%}
    {%- render 'gs-media', image: image, preset: 'tile', sizes: sizes, mode: 'artwork', title: work.title.value -%}
  {%- else -%}
    <div class="gs-media gs-media--artwork gs-shape-md gs-media--blank" aria-hidden="true"><span class="gs-label">{{ 'collection.no_image' | t }}</span></div>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if names != blank and hide_artist != true -%}
    <p class="gs-artwork-tile__artist">{{ names | escape }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}
  <{{ tag }} class="gs-artwork-tile__title">
    <a href="{{ work.system.url }}"><cite>{{ work.title.value | escape }}</cite>{% if work.year.value != blank %}, {{ work.year.value | escape }}{% endif %}</a>
  </{{ tag }}>
  {%- if work.medium.value != blank -%}
    <p class="gs-meta gs-artwork-tile__medium">{{ work.medium.value | escape }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}
</article>
